      "side": 1,
      "message": "There\u0027s a couple of odd things happening with the eSPI interface during the sysjump that I haven\u0027t figured out yet.\nSome of the calls like system_jump_to_this_image() may not work at the SYS_INIT\ntime. I found (for example) that system_jumped_late() does not return the correct value because it relies on initialisation that occurs after all the SYS_INIT\ninitialisation. This is being worked on.",
